&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bob-hedges-89855a3b/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bob Hedges&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, Retired Chief Data Officer, Visa; and Research Fellow at the Initiative for the Digital Economy, MIT&lt;/p&gt;
