&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eli Cohen, &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Founder, OSMOS; Co-Founder &amp;amp; CEO, Tappify&lt;/li&gt;
