&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lamont-Doherty experts will explore the full spectrum of pollution, from the emissions humans produce to the resulting health impacts. They will provide insights across scales, revealing how human activity affects both the environment and public health.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
